            f"{shooter.name} gets bumped off his spot and shoots off-balance.",
            f"{shooter.name} runs out of room and settles for a fadeaway look.",
            f"{shooter.name} loses his footing but throws one up anyway.",
            f"{shooter.name} gets caught in no-man's land and forces a rushed shot.",
            f"{shooter.name} is smothered the whole way and barely gets it off.",
            f"{shooter.name} tries every counter and still can't shake free.",
            f"{shooter.name} settles for a low-percentage look under duress.",
            f"{shooter.name} forces up an awkward shot with the defender draped on him.",
            f"{shooter.name} can't create any airspace and shoots through traffic.",
