            f"{defender.name} is glued to his hip on every single dribble.",
            f"{defender.name} plays it perfectly, cutting off every escape route.",
            f"{defender.name} refuses to give up the matchup, no matter what {shooter.name} tries.",
            f"{defender.name} is doing elite point-of-attack work, and {shooter.name} feels it.",
            f"{defender.name} reads every counter before it happens and stays in front.",
            f"{defender.name} makes him work for every inch, and it still isn't enough.",
            f"{defender.name} is a brick wall on this possession, and {shooter.name} can't move him.",
            f"{defender.name} stonewalls every attempt to create space.",
            f"{defender.name} is picture-perfect on the closeout and never lets up.",
